# Gmail SMTP Configuration with Google App Password
# NOTE: This uses Google App Password, NOT your regular Gmail password

# Vercel Environment Variables (use these exact names in Vercel dashboard)
EMAIL_USER=your-gmail@gmail.com
EMAIL_PASS=xxxx xxxx xxxx xxxx

# Optional SMTP settings (defaults shown)
SMTP_HOST=smtp.gmail.com
SMTP_PORT=587
EMAIL_FROM=your-gmail@gmail.com
EMAIL_TO=your-gmail@gmail.com

# How to get a Google App Password:
# 1. Go to myaccount.google.com/security
# 2. Enable 2-factor authentication if not already on
# 3. Search "App Passwords" and generate one for "Mail"
# 4. Copy the 16-char code (format: xxxx xxxx xxxx xxxx)

# Vercel Deployment Instructions:
# 1. Go to Vercel dashboard > Project Settings > Environment Variables
# 2. Add EMAIL_USER and EMAIL_PASS with your real values
# 3. Deploy the project
